# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the index and in the working tree.
# Without this, a Windows-side tool (editor, formatter, PowerShell redirect) can
# silently rewrite whole trees to CRLF and turn a one-file change into a 31-file
# diff. `text=auto` still leaves detected binaries untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The dashboard build output is generated: never diffed or merged as text, and
# collapsed in review (FR-117). Rebuild with `npm run build` in dashboard/.
plugin/tools/dashboard/dist/** binary linguist-generated
